name: Rocket — boss-bounty economy
author: corpus
description: >-
  Rocket earns $1 at the end of every round; payout increases by $2 when a Boss Blind is
  defeated. First-shop economy: scales through boss kills, so pair with boss-avoidance
  or fast-clear tools.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Rocket
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: ToTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: GoldenJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
